{% set sig = default(signature, "") %}
RULES:
- FIRST PERSON from the author, addressed directly to {{ recipientName }} ("you"). Roughly 2-5 sentences — a note someone actually paid ink and a courier for, not an essay.
- The letter MUST accomplish: {{ goal }}
- Tone: {{ tone }}
- Ground every claim in the situation above. Invent NO new facts, names, places, gold amounts, or events. If the situation names an amount, use it exactly.
